WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.452
Dad: Want to take Lucky for a walk, Sam?

2
00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:10.227
Sam: Yes! Can we go to the playground?

3
00:00:10.228 --> 00:00:11.637
Dad: Sure.

4
00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:14.110
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

5
00:00:14.111 --> 00:00:19.991
Sam: That's right, Lucky. We're going for a

6
00:00:19.992 --> 00:00:22.715
walk! Dad: How was the Nature Center

7
00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:24.691
today? Sam: It was

8
00:00:24.692 --> 00:00:27.840
fun. We saw a deer and a hawk.

9
00:00:27.841 --> 00:00:32.379
But Tia did not like the bees! Look

10
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:36.272
at that! What is it? Dad: They're

11
00:00:36.273 --> 00:00:43.531
making a garden. Let's go see. Rosa:

12
00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:46.421
Hi! I'm Rosa. Dad:

13
00:00:46.422 --> 00:00:48.783
Are you planting a garden? Rosa:

14
00:00:48.784 --> 00:00:53.403
Yes. Anyone from Sea Grove can grow things here. Sam:

15
00:00:53.404 --> 00:00:56.941
Oh. It's a community garden. Rosa:

16
00:00:56.942 --> 00:00:58.443
Yes! Sam:

17
00:00:58.444 --> 00:01:01.257
Can you plant vegetables here? Rosa:

18
00:01:01.258 --> 00:01:03.684
You bet! Sam:

19
00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:06.804
Bye, Rosa! Thanks. Dad:

20
00:01:06.805 --> 00:01:09.435
I didn't know you like to garden, Sam.

21
00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:10.848
Sam: I don't.

22
00:01:10.849 --> 00:01:13.403
Dad: Then why . . .?

23
00:01:13.404 --> 00:01:16.646
Sam: Mom! Guess what?

24
00:01:16.647 --> 00:01:18.134
Mom: What?

25
00:01:18.135 --> 00:01:25.445
Sam: You can plant a vegetable garden!

